  "scientific_review": [
    "All32predeclared Guiana6-7.5N/northern EGCC66-64.5N section/date targets retained exactly,including all no-selection,gate/support-edge and primary-censored results. Native components,coordinates,indices,hyperslabs,timestamps,nulls,scores/local maxima and layers remain exact cloud output.",
    "Sixty-seven cloud checks in12/10/5/5/8/8/10/9groups;58frozen kernels/geometry/shared-read checks plus9new source tests. Frames315/225degree,upper100m diagnostic,32targets,full-depth tracing,edge retention,mutations,missing deeper support,pins and uninherited parent context checked. Initial failed cloud run stopped before field acquisition on a copied test-basis label;only that unvalidated test literal and its pinned hash corrected,not fields or measurement declarations.",
    "Fresh Baklouti2007 primary Abstract,Sec2/Table1,Sec3.1/Sec5 distinguishes early oscillating/later northwestward shelf flow,questions permanent Guyana current at22m and below. M2valid13-118m is instrument support,not bottom;130m mounting/150.3m bed/integration extrapolations are separate. Regional6-7.5N searches are not historical M2replication or independently confirmed permanent current identity. Offshore NBC/rings,southeastward undercurrent,plume boundaries and Caribbean continuation excluded.",
    "Fresh SutherlandPickart2008 primary accepted manuscript abstract,Sec3/3.5/8/9 describes summer2004 low-salinity surface-intensified inner EGC branch,weak68Nidentification and63Nmerger. Northern66-64.5Nsubset excludes merger/CapeFarewell/WestGreenland extension. Editorial gates do not prove bathymetric inner-shelf placement or separate coastal from parent shelfbreak flow. EGCC parent relationship non-additive;no parent depths inherited. Pinned Bacon2002Aug1997reported100m reach/160m bed are separate local context;fresh publisher fetch unavailable,no inaccessible fulltext review claimed.",
    "Complete finite0-100m positive signed integral/core>10cm/s is an OSW upper-layer component diagnostic,not measured100m thickness or a depth calibrated from instrument/source reach. No positive surface,relative surface,thermal/salinity gate. Greatest eligible integral wins,first western tie retained;gate/support-edge maxima unresolved without weaker replacement or retuning. Sensitivities5/10/20cm/s keep own seed at same column and cannot fill primary gaps.",
    "Frozen full native0-5000m finite adjacent tracing retains upper/lower/status/bounds/span without sign/cutoff/missing bridging. Selection endpoints,source reach,instrument/bed/integration/property limits are not imposed bottoms. Same-sign parent/neighboring/deeper flow may merge. Coastal masks,shallow complete-window support,narrow-jet resolution and ring/parent contamination remain unvalidated. Span is not physical thickness,current/water-mass validation or de-tided residual circulation.",
    "All32targets share fixed250000pairs/7MBdecoded caps,40levels,3-150profiles,20000pairs/patch,5km tolerances and one bounded reader/reserve/ledger,max3exactNetCDFIOfailure retries2/5seconds,future first attempts,no successful replay/per-owner/per-quarter reset/cap increase. Array counts are not wire traffic or precision.",
    "Quarterly2022probes are not seasonal means,annual extrema,historical joint occupations or whole-current physical depth. Missing/model-masked support remains unknown,not absence,zero orbed. No width/volume/state join/global sum. Fields,numerics,geometry/tests cloud-only,sequential,one idleCPU. Registerv48,inventoryv34 and eddy102size-referenced/34unresolved baseline preserved;runtime/query integration remains unfinished."
